#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:4
msgid "Working with filesystems"
msgstr "Bekerja dengan filesystem"

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:10
msgid ""
"This tutorial describes how the OpenMV Cam provides an on-device filesystem,"
" allowing standard Python file I/O methods to be used with persistent "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini menjelaskan bagaimana OpenMV Cam menyediakan filesystem pada "
"perangkat, memungkinkan metode I/O file Python standar digunakan dengan "
"penyimpanan persisten."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:13
msgid ""
"The OpenMV Cam creates a default configuration and auto-detects and mounts "
"the primary filesystem on power-on, so this tutorial is mostly useful if you"
" want to repartition the flash, change the filesystem type, or use a custom "
"block device."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV Cam membuat konfigurasi default dan secara otomatis mendeteksi serta "
"memasang filesystem utama saat dinyalakan, sehingga tutorial ini paling "
"berguna jika Anda ingin mempartisi ulang flash, mengubah jenis filesystem, "
"atau menggunakan block device kustom."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:18
msgid ""
"The filesystem is backed by the internal flash memory, or by an SD card when"
" one is installed."
msgstr ""
"Filesystem didukung oleh memori flash internal, atau oleh kartu SD jika "
"kartu tersebut terpasang."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:22
msgid "VFS"
msgstr "VFS"

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:24
msgid ""
"MicroPython implements a Unix-like Virtual File System (VFS) layer. All "
"mounted filesystems are combined into a single virtual filesystem, starting "
"at the root ``/``. Filesystems are mounted into directories in this "
"structure, and at startup the working directory is set to the primary "
"filesystem."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython mengimplementasikan lapisan Virtual File System (VFS) seperti "
"Unix. Semua filesystem yang dipasang digabungkan menjadi satu filesystem "
"virtual, dimulai dari root ``/``\\ . Filesystem dipasang ke direktori dalam "
"struktur ini, dan saat startup direktori kerja diatur ke filesystem utama."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:29
msgid ""
"On the OpenMV Cam the internal flash is mounted at ``/flash`` and is the "
"working directory. If an SD card is installed it is mounted at ``/sdcard`` "
"and becomes the working directory instead."
msgstr ""
"Pada OpenMV Cam, flash internal dipasang di ``/flash`` dan menjadi direktori"
" kerja. Jika kartu SD terpasang, kartu tersebut dipasang di ``/sdcard`` dan "
"menjadi direktori kerja sebagai gantinya."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:34
msgid "Block devices"
msgstr "Block devices"

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:36
msgid ""
"A block device is an instance of a class that implements the "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` protocol."
msgstr ""
"Block device adalah instansi dari sebuah kelas yang mengimplementasikan "
"protokol :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`\\ ."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:39
msgid ""
"On power-on the OpenMV Cam attempts to detect the filesystem on the internal"
" flash (or SD card) and configure and mount it automatically. If no "
"filesystem is found, a FAT filesystem spanning the entire flash is created. "
"To erase or reformat the on-board filesystem the easiest path is OpenMV IDE "
"or a :ref:`factory reset <soft_bricking>`; the lower-level Python API below "
"is for advanced/programmatic use."
msgstr ""
"Saat dinyalakan, OpenMV Cam mencoba mendeteksi filesystem pada flash "
"internal (atau kartu SD) dan secara otomatis mengonfigurasi serta "
"memasangnya. Jika tidak ada filesystem yang ditemukan, filesystem FAT yang "
"mencakup seluruh flash akan dibuat. Untuk menghapus atau memformat ulang "
"filesystem di papan, cara termudah adalah melalui OpenMV IDE atau "
":ref:`factory reset <soft_bricking>`\\ ; API Python tingkat rendah di bawah "
"ini digunakan untuk keperluan lanjutan/terprogram."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:47
msgid "Internal flash"
msgstr "Flash internal"

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:49
msgid ""
"On STM32-based OpenMV Cams the :ref:`pyb.Flash <pyb.Flash>` class provides "
"access to the internal flash. On boards which have larger external flash it "
"will use that instead. The ``start`` kwarg should always be specified, i.e. "
"``pyb.Flash(start=0)``."
msgstr ""
"Pada OpenMV Cams berbasis STM32, kelas :ref:`pyb.Flash <pyb.Flash>` "
"menyediakan akses ke flash internal. Pada papan yang memiliki flash "
"eksternal yang lebih besar, kelas ini akan menggunakan flash tersebut. "
"Argumen kata kunci ``start`` harus selalu ditentukan, yaitu "
"``pyb.Flash(start=0)``\\ ."

#: ../../reference/filesystem.rst:54
msgid ""
"Note: For backwards compatibility, when constructed with no arguments (i.e. "
"``pyb.Flash()``), it only implements the simple block interface and reflects"
" the virtual device presented to USB mass storage (i.e. it includes a "
"virtual partition table at the start)."
msgstr ""
"Catatan: Untuk kompatibilitas mundur, ketika dibuat tanpa argumen (yaitu "
"``pyb.Flash()``\\ ), hanya mengimplementasikan antarmuka blok sederhana dan "
"mencerminkan perangkat virtual yang disajikan ke USB mass storage (yaitu "
"mencakup tabel partisi virtual di awal)."

